+an initiator-target &quot;session&quot;.</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-2.1-1.15">iSCSI Name:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-2.1-1.16">The name of an iSCSI initiator or iSCSI target.</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-2.1-1.17">iSCSI Node:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-2.1-1.18">The iSCSI Node represents a single iSCSI initiator or
