+explicitly specified by the initiator during Login.</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-2.1-1.29">I_T nexus:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-2.1-1.30">According to <xref target="SAM2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="SAM2"/>, the I_T nexus is a relationship
+between a SCSI Initiator Port and a SCSI Target Port.  For iSCSI,
+this relationship is a session, defined as a relationship between
